   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Developmental trajectories are shaped by the interaction between behavior and context. Using examples from your own life, discuss how your behavior (e.g., decisions regarding education, work, or personal development) and the context (e.g., family background, socioeconomic status, or geographic location) have interacted to influence your current developmental trajectory. How do these factors work together to impact your future career or educational outcomes?",
